{"schema":"jovie.win/v1","date":"2026-10-29","receipts":[],"id":"win-2026-10-29-resolver-coverage","area":"quality","theme":"resolver-coverage","claim":"The music resolver links a UPC to Spotify for 97.5% of a 319-release benchmark and resolves artist plus title to Spotify for 71.8%, with zero links to a different release.","prs":[{"repo":"JovieInc/Jovie","number":23749,"mergedAt":"2026-10-29T19:52:21Z"},{"repo":"JovieInc/Jovie","number":23752,"mergedAt":null}],"metrics":[{"name":"UPC to Spotify useful coverage","unit":"%","better":"higher","before":1.6,"after":97.5,"source":"jovie.resolver-benchmark/v1 receipt, 319 releases from 61 artists, live on Gem 2026-10-29, candidate 9a8e12bb74, rescored with same-UPC twins as correct","query":"pnpm benchmark:music-resolver apps/web/lib/music-resolver/parity/fixtures/spotify-catalog-benchmark.v1.jsonl (correct / n, upc_to_spotify)"},{"name":"Artist and title to Spotify useful coverage","unit":"%","better":"higher","before":0,"after":71.8,"source":"same receipt","query":"same command (correct / n, name_to_spotify)"},{"name":"Links to a different release","unit":"count","better":"lower","before":0,"after":0,"source":"same receipt: wrong with a different UPC, both cases","query":"same command (wrong, upc_to_spotify and name_to_spotify)"}],"verifyLink":"https://github.com/JovieInc/Jovie/pull/23749","notes":"Before values are the #23729 first run (5/319 and 0/319). Strict Spotify-id scoring gives 96.6% and 70.9% because 3 releases returned a playable same-UPC twin of the corpus id; the coordinator decision on 2026-10-29 counts a playable twin as correct and the benchmark reports it as wrongSameUpcTwin. After-values were rescored from the receipt, not re-run."}
